          <div class="tour-copy">
            <h3>One window for REST, streams and AI tools.</h3>
            <p>Send HTTP, GraphQL and gRPC, hold open WebSocket, Socket.IO and SSE connections, and call MCP servers by hand: Kurlo lists their tools and fills the arguments from the schema.</p>
            <ul class="ticks">
              <li>OAuth 2.0 with all four grants, PKCE and automatic refresh</li>
              <li>AWS SigV4, Digest, API keys and client certificates</li>
              <li>Diff a response against the last one or a saved example</li>
              <li>Copy as code in 14 languages, with secrets left as placeholders</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="tour-link" href={href('docs/guides/request-types/')}>Request types →</a>
          </div>
