<span class="ok">✓</span> POST /login   <span class="d">→</span> 200  <span class="d">88ms</span>  [2/2]
<span class="ok">✓</span> GET  /me      <span class="d">→</span> 200  <span class="d">41ms</span>  [3/3]
<span class="d">2 passed · 0 failed · exit 0</span></pre>
